  "solution": {
    "text": "Hint: \r\nCentre and radius of $z \\bar{z}+\\bar{a} z+a \\bar{z}+b=0$ are $-a$ and $\\sqrt{|a|^{2}-b} \\therefore$ radius $=\\sqrt{13-4}=3$"
